                                "sense_id": "ec43b13c-65a6-320e-b7c5-9fdd413ae44b",
                                "text": "Governments must \"outline how they will reassure passengers that it will be as safe as possible to travel by public transport\", according to industry watchdogs Transport Focus and London TravelWatch."
                            },
