                                "sense_id": "ec43b13c-65a6-320e-b7c5-9fdd413ae44b",
                                "text": "The UK’s data watchdog is seeking clarification from Mark Zuckerberg’s Meta about parental controls on its popular virtual reality headset, as campaigners warned that it could breach an online children’s safety code."
                            }
